  <h2>Objects come before methods</h2>
  <p>A code or representation cannot decide which physical state or observable a question requires. Part I therefore begins with electrons and nuclei as one coupled quantum problem; later Parts introduce new objects only when the preceding description becomes insufficient.</p>
  <p><a href={href('/theory/')}>Foundations</a> repairs prerequisites, while <a href={href('/reading/')}>Guided Reading</a> follows an individual source. Core supplies the Atlas’s continuous synthesis. When that understanding becomes an actual calculation, <a href="http://188.255.156.20/DFT-Research-Workflow/">DFT Research Workflow</a> takes over execution, convergence, validation, and evidence.</p>

